{
  "_comment": [
    "The one language table. Everything that needs to know which languages Ryoku",
    "speaks reads this file: sync.py (what to generate), the Hub's Global page",
    "(the picker), I18n.qml (name -> file code, text direction), the Go runtime",
    "(ryoku/i18n/langs.go embeds it) and i18n.sh (the installer). Add a language",
    "here and nowhere else.",
    "",
    "code    the catalog file name, catalog/<code>.json. A regional variant uses",
    "        an underscore (pt_BR), matching Qt.locale().name.",
    "native  what the picker shows: the language's own name, so someone who",
    "        cannot read the current UI language can still find theirs.",
    "google  the target code for the keyless Google engine (sync --engine google).",
    "dir     ltr, or rtl for a right-to-left script (mirrors the layout).",
    "locale  the glibc locale the installer offers with this language."
  ],
